{"seq":3,"slug":"space-accuracy-tradeoff","title":"空间与精度权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/foundations/space-accuracy-tradeoff","wordCount":1731,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"空间与精度权衡\">空间与精度权衡</h1><p>概率数据结构的全部魔力，可以浓缩成一句话：多花一个比特，就能少错一点。这句话背后是一条平滑的权衡曲线——空间、误差率、查询速度三者之间存在可量化的换算关系，知道其中两个就能算出第三个。这一篇的目标是把这条曲线写成公式，让你以后看到任何一种概率结构，都能立刻问出正确的问题：要达到目标误差，得花多少空间？给定空间预算，误差能压到多低？这套数学语言会成为后面每一篇做参数选型时的统一标尺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>概率数据结构的价值，全部来自空间、误差、速度三者之间一条可量化的换算曲线：多花一点空间换一点精度，每种结构只是这条曲线上不同的工作点。要把这条曲线用好，得先理解它的三个支柱——信息论为什么允许近似突破精确结构的空间下界、三个互相牵制的旋钮如何联动、以及误差在合并与累积中如何传播。下面把这三件事写成公式与对照表，作为后面每篇选型时共用的标尺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信息论给出的空间下界\">信息论给出的空间下界</h2><p>要理解近似为什么能省空间，先得知道精确结构的空间花在哪。考虑一个最纯粹的问题：用一个数据结构表示包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个元素的集合（元素取自一个巨大的全集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>），支持精确的成员查询。信息论告诉我们，要无歧义地区分所有可能的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 元素子集，至少需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 \\binom{|U|}{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.319em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.969em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 比特。当全集很大时，这个量近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\log_2 |U|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>——也就是每个元素都得存下完整身份，空间随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 线性增长且系数不小。</p>\n<p>现在放松要求：允许误判率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 的假阳性。此时下界骤降。可以证明，一个支持误判率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 的近似成员结构，每个元素的空间下界约为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.44</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>ε</mi></mfrac><mtext> 比特/元素</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.44 \\log_2 \\frac{1}{\\varepsilon} \\text{ 比特/元素}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.44</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">比特</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">元素</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在于：这个下界<strong>不依赖全集大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|U|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></strong>，只依赖你愿意容忍的误差。误差从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span> 放到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>，每元素只需约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.8</span></span></span></span></span> 比特变成约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.2</span></span></span></span></span> 比特。正是「放弃精确身份、只保留区分能力」这一步，把空间从「每元素几十上百比特」压到了「每元素几比特」。这条下界就是上一篇<a href=\"why-probabilistic\">为什么用概率数据结构</a>里所说「精确结构空间墙」的严格出处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三个旋钮-空间-误差-速度\">三个旋钮：空间、误差、速度</h2><p>每一种概率结构都可以看成有三个互相牵制的旋钮，调动其中任意一个都会影响另外两个。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[空间预算 m] --&gt; E[误差率 ε]&#10;  E --&gt; S&#10;  K[哈希个数 / 行数 k] --&gt; E&#10;  K --&gt; T[查询速度]&#10;  S --&gt; E2[空间越大误差越低]&#10;  K --&gt; E3[更多哈希压低误差但变慢]&#10;  T --&gt; TT[速度由哈希次数主导]&#10;  E --&gt; R[三者构成一条权衡曲线]&#10;  S --&gt; R&#10;  T --&gt; R\">flowchart TD\n  S[空间预算 m] --&gt; E[误差率 ε]\n  E --&gt; S\n  K[哈希个数 / 行数 k] --&gt; E\n  K --&gt; T[查询速度]\n  S --&gt; E2[空间越大误差越低]\n  K --&gt; E3[更多哈希压低误差但变慢]\n  T --&gt; TT[速度由哈希次数主导]\n  E --&gt; R[三者构成一条权衡曲线]\n  S --&gt; R\n  T --&gt; R</pre><p>以布隆过滤器为例，三个旋钮的关系最清晰：位数组大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>、元素数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、哈希个数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 共同决定误判率。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，存在一个最优的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 使误判率最低；哈希越多，单次查询越慢。这套具体公式会在<a href=\"../membership/bloom-filters\">布隆过滤器</a>里完整推导，这里只点明三者互相牵制的结构。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>旋钮</th>\n<th>调大的好处</th>\n<th>调大的代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>误差率下降</td>\n<td>内存占用上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希个数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>在合适范围内压低误差</td>\n<td>查询变慢；超过最优值反而升误差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容忍误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>空间需求大幅下降</td>\n<td>答案更不可靠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"误差是如何累积与传播的\">误差是如何累积与传播的</h2><p>单次查询的误差只是故事的一半。真实系统里，概率结构会被合并、被串联、被长期累积使用，误差会以特定方式传播——不理解这一点，会在生产中遇到「单测误差达标、上线后误差爆炸」的怪事。</p>\n<p>第一种是<strong>填充导致的退化</strong>。布隆过滤器的误判率是随插入元素数单调上升的：按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 设计的过滤器，塞进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span></span></span></span></span> 个元素后误判率会远超预期。所以容量必须按峰值规划，这一点会在<a href=\"../practice/pitfalls-tuning\">陷阱与调参</a>里作为头号坑展开。</p>\n<p>第二种是<strong>合并时的误差叠加</strong>。两个 HyperLogLog 合并估计并集基数时，误差不是简单相加，而遵循各自方差合成的规律。这正是 HLL 与 <a href=\"../cardinality-frequency/count-min-sketch\">Count-Min Sketch</a> 在分布式场景大放异彩的原因——它们的合并是无损或误差可控的，能在多节点各自累积、最后汇总。</p>\n<p>第三种是<strong>置信区间而非确定值</strong>。HyperLogLog 给的是「基数约为 X，标准误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.04</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>m</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.04/\\sqrt{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.04/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」这样的区间，而非确定值。把估计当确定值用，会在小样本或边界情况下被误差咬到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不同结构的空间效率横向对比\">不同结构的空间效率横向对比</h2><p>把这条权衡曲线放到 hub 涉及的几种主要结构上横向看一眼，能建立量级直觉。下面是大致的「空间随什么增长」对比——注意它们解决的问题不同，比的不是优劣而是各自的空间-精度位置。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>空间随…增长</th>\n<th>典型空间量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确集合</td>\n<td>精确成员</td>\n<td>元素数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 线性</td>\n<td>每元素几十~上百字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布隆过滤器</td>\n<td>近似成员</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 线性但系数极小</td>\n<td>每元素约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.44</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.44\\log_2(1/\\varepsilon)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.44</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 比特</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HyperLogLog</td>\n<td>基数</td>\n<td>与基数几乎无关</td>\n<td>固定几 KB 估上亿基数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Count-Min Sketch</td>\n<td>频率</td>\n<td>与误差和置信度有关，与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 无关</td>\n<td>固定一张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w\\times d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>t-digest / KLL</td>\n<td>分位数</td>\n<td>与精度有关，亚线性</td>\n<td>固定几 KB 估全分布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最值得记住的对比是：布隆过滤器的空间仍随元素数线性增长（只是系数极小），而 HyperLogLog、Count-Min、分位数概要的空间几乎与数据规模脱钩——这正是它们能处理无界流的根本原因。这个量级差异，会在<a href=\"../cardinality-frequency/\">第三章</a>和<a href=\"../practice/\">第四章</a>里反复被用到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>近似成员结构的空间下界约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.44</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.44\\log_2(1/\\varepsilon)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.44</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 比特/元素，且不依赖全集大小——这是放弃精确身份换来的根本节省。</li>\n<li>每种结构都有空间、误差、速度三个互相牵制的旋钮，调一个会牵动另外两个，构成一条可量化的权衡曲线。</li>\n<li>误差会通过填充退化、合并叠加、置信区间三种方式传播，单次查询误差达标不等于系统级误差达标。</li>\n<li>布隆过滤器空间仍随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 线性增长（系数极小），而 HyperLogLog、Count-Min、分位数概要的空间几乎与数据规模脱钩，故能处理无界流。</li>\n<li>这套空间-误差-速度的换算关系，是后面每一篇做参数选型时共用的标尺。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"空间与精度权衡","id":"空间与精度权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"信息论给出的空间下界","id":"信息论给出的空间下界"},{"level":2,"text":"三个旋钮：空间、误差、速度","id":"三个旋钮-空间-误差-速度"},{"level":2,"text":"误差是如何累积与传播的","id":"误差是如何累积与传播的"},{"level":2,"text":"不同结构的空间效率横向对比","id":"不同结构的空间效率横向对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"哈希基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/foundations/hashing-foundations"},"next":{"title":"布隆过滤器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/membership/bloom-filters"}}